Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear girl, how I wish I had never\Nbrought you into this wretched world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I see that I've yet\Nto break free of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed worm, now I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it you said about fate?\NYou just climb. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well i hope you like flying\Ninstead there you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the language, we\Nchipped the woman Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessuno può succedere\Nun destino scelto Roman
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,solo il risultato che\Nnon sarebbe distrutto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:02:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,L 'interna Zoom esiste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,solo del me Puoi cantare
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Canzoni di tristezza.\NThe end of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:03:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it's her soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta act!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to seize my fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At last you're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With this victory, fate's\Ndesigns are finally realized!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now behold, as Emperor Crimson's\Nglorious ascension at last begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it idle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, those brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What could they have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I can't grasp it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What foul affliction have you handed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you children\Nhave broken my grasp?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever had me glued\Nin there just went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This wind, could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a curious revelation, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all your fervid boasting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,those allegedly flawless\Neyes didn't see this coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrogant swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I must thank you—you've\Nshown us the path to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem's power;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:05:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,its crux appears to be this luminescent\Nsphere floating behind each of of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One need only crush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your desire for the arrow\Nstopped you from completely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,destroying Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I, however, feel no such inclination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I could end it all in a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Think for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone worthier?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you name even one person? Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that I am\Nworthy of becoming king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never allow your feeble\Nhands to touch the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's souls will\Nreturn to their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Post-haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's rushing back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's Trisha's soul! He's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Girardi, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd\Npull it off, but you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Giorno, it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, you're the body that we...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,back at the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, thank you for\Nall that you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When you and I met for\Nthe first time in Napoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,when we joined forces against the Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,though my body became marked for death\Nby Fate's hand, my soul was reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You revived my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for showing me true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give everyone my regards, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You imputant wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Such tedious bilge, all for some girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll rot in hell, you\NPhilistine mounds of excrement!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to send\Nall of you there myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I conquer the arrow,\Nyour worthless lives will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Esu's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's never do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't have Trish nearly died twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a little help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're worried about Bucciarati,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll be back here\Nbefore you know it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fear, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm simply returning to the\Npath I was meant to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The path to my origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Benedict!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it that once said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We all stand as soldiers,\Nchosen by destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How quaint this world has\Ntaught me other truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate has bestowed upon me an extraordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,power to obliterate\Ntime and see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As such, only one spot suits\Nme in the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Emperor Crimson, am destiny's\Nchosen to reign at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere soldier I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't I seize the arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth did I fail such a small task?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not be now, but\Nvictory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I must rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I will bide my time and strike\Nwhen the moment is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been beaten, only delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My powers will thrust me\Nback to the top in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, don't let him run. Stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If he gets away, he'll go into\NHayden, and he'll disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he does, we'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean, I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running with his tail tucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's holding it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the arrow's\Npicked its new master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears retreat was\Nnever an option after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I must face him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My dignity demands it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't overthrow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as you might, you will\Nnever tear me from my throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't run from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be unbecoming of a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When you said he was running,\Nwhich way'd you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to take us\Ndown with him or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck up all that arrow's power and show\Nmy father what Golden Wind is made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No such thing will\Ntranspire, dear daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, I'm glad your\Nwords goaded me into staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've reminded me to\Nalways guard my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I held my ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I actually fled, I never would have\Ngotten to witness this thrilling vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Emperor Crimson\NEulogy, for this sumptuous sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So come on that arrow's power and show\Nmy father what Golden Wind is made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But why it looked like it\Nworked? What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How lovely to be back on the\Ncourse of victory and right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,when I thought despair had\Nfinally Caught me in its grip
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but the wounds you inflicted on my\Npride steered me toward the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I would not have realized how\Ntruly close I was to winning
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna, what did\Nyou hope to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow won't sully\Nitself with the feeble?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you already forget what\Nthe detestable turtle said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy, only a worthy wielder\Ncan lay claim to with strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How glad it must be then\Nthat I chose to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die like the weakling you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone, wretched dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To be slain by a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:13:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A final gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's something more than\Njust blood coming out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How, how did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be another trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt his bones shattered to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brain matter should be spilling\Nfrom his corpse right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what is this bizarre substance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the arrow choose him after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what's burrowing into his body?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You die now, Giorno Javada!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:14:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno didn't get rejected by the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It might have taken its time,\Nbut turns out he was worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But it almost looks like the arrow's\Nbecome a whole new part of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss can't take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me nuts, but I think\Nit's stuck to Giorno for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What hellish nightmare has engulfed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't make a single mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand bore a hole through his\Nmiserable skull moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be on the ground,\Ndead, in a pool of viscera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except this time it's Giorno's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Golden Wind Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The air around them is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They've transcended the arrow's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The only lasting thing is truth itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Righteous actions born of truth
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,will live past the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know their virtuous spirits live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was their will that the\Narrow be handed down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's see, are your\Nactions founded on truth
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or are they the transient\Nproducts of shallow evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll know soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really as unbreakable as\Nyou repeatedly claim to be, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he planning on doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, please don't\Nswap our souls again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Jorno's\Nreally certain himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But from what I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not gonna have to\Nworry about him suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,losing control over\NRequiem anymore at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His attack managed to evade my prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I did see it\Ncoming, just not in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The vision of a projectile\Nbursting through my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it saved me from the full brunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still dodge his\Nstrikes at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question. Golden Wind's\Nnewfound strength is nothing to scoff at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But that ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gained little more\Nthan a harder swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson can still preempt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing my powers can't overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the ride while you can, dear Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to crush your skull\Nproperly this time, as fate ordains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A little boy like you should learn to\Ntemper his bravado, lest he's punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even strip you of any chance\Nto regret your actions, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Emperor Crimson!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Time will now be obliterated\Nfor all but me! Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see his stance movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His machinations have\Nbeen laid utterly bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Talentless roaches, at\Nleast try to surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing how little it takes to totally\Nneutralize your greatest power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor fools, I almost feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again will you witness the\Nimmaculate brilliance of Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth of my strength\Nwill be forever lost to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I'm still faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new powers couldn't stop\Nme from ripping out your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The future can only hold one\Nof us, and it has chosen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he reversing the\Ntime? I obliterated that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,shouldn't be possible no\Nstop it's all reverting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.74,0:19:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,back to normal but still the premonition
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,clearly shows me emerging\Nthe victor So perish,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:19:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Javada!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That curse somehow\Npulled one over my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that can move within\Nperiods of warp time should be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is plain truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are not deceiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What you see is very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing out before you are\Nthe results of your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, though you might be\Nable to witness the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you can never hope to reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your powers are immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could ever overcome this barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Golden Wind\NRequiem's true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Its nature remains a secret even\Nto my user, Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lest he's punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even strip you of any chance\Nto regret your actions, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's right before I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I may bend time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, my premonitions\Nalways become reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The future has already been written!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson is bound for victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll see this alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we're the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.16,0:22:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.88,0:23:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
